33,gpio_reg_wr_rd_test,Overall Test,GPIO Register Write-Read Test: Validates all 49 GPIO registers (gp0 block) for correct reset/default values and write-read integrity using 6 test patterns. Uses GPIO0=1 macro. VRRW registers are skipped per skip_array. Test passes if def_fail_cnt==0 AND wr_fail_cnt==0.,All gp0 registers,0x00-0xC0,32,All fields per register,Various,RO/RW/RW2/WO/VRRW,Per register spec,Per register,Per register,6 patterns,Per formula,finish(0) if no failures; finish(1) if any failure,Per skip_array,Per skip_rst_array,program.c / test_define.c,GPIO,GPIO0=1 / CNT=49,1 / 49,Complete GPIO register validation test
